# SwarmSaga: Distributed Transaction Hypervisor

SwarmSaga is Stage 4 of the Swarm Suite Agent Hypervisor stack. It provides write-ahead state journaling, forward DAG execution, and deterministic topological backward compensation for multi-agent workflows across codebases, databases, containers, and external APIs.
